  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trajectories: experiences of young Spanish residents abroad and expectations of return</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x201c;Trajectories: Experiences of Young Spanish People Living Abroad and Their Expectations of Returning&#x201d; aims to support the Spanish Government in developing evidence-based migration policies targeting young Spanish nationals residing overseas. To achieve this, the initiative seeks to generate rigorous and up-to-date through a study that will analyze the profiles, motivations, migration trajectories, ties to Spain, and return plans of young Spaniards abroad.</narrative>
  </description>
